Specifically, the following files are copied from Detectron2 v0.6 and modified
only to register this project's dataset and to remove settings that did not
apply:

  - tools/train_net.py
  - tools/plain_train_net.py
  - tools/benchmark.py
  - tools/analyze_model.py
  - tools/visualize_data.py
  - tools/visualize_json_results.py
  - tools/export_model.py
  - cardamage/predictor.py            (from Detectron2's demo/predictor.py)
  - configs/Base-RCNN-DilatedC5.yaml
  - configs/damage_mask_rcnn_R_101_DC5_3x.yaml
                                      (from configs/COCO-InstanceSegmentation/
                                       mask_rcnn_R_101_DC5_3x.yaml)

The released checkpoint was trained with Detectron2 v0.6 and initialised from
the ImageNet-pretrained ResNet-101 published in the Detectron2 model zoo
(detectron2://ImageNetPretrained/MSRA/R-101.pkl).

The VIA-to-COCO conversion under datasets/via2coco/ derives from the community
via2coco converter and retains its structure; the hardcoded paths, dataset
metadata and dead sample blocks were replaced with command-line arguments.

